  "description": "A bundle pack of 10+ Procreate watercolor brushes for digital art of the iPad / iPad Pro app. A natural realistic watery paint blending effect for blending and smudging colors and producing a wet ink. Giving an emotional and painterly aesthetic to illustrating, painting, drawing features and makeup in portrait art, faces, eyes, nose, lips, contouring, sketching landscape art, clouds, oceans, forests, distressed grunge watercolor paintings, character art, anime, abstract designs, graphic design drawn features, fashion illustrations and more. The brushes have pressure sensitivity and are compatible with the Apple Pencil. They start with more paint when you press more and some have pressure sensitive width too so the paint strokes have a have a brush-like effect of being finer width when you press less and getting wider when you press more. Comes as 1 .brushset file in a .zip file.\nINCLUDES:\n1 .brushset file with 14 brushes\n*REQUIRES PROCREATE APP & IPAD / IPAD PRO\nThanks so much for stopping by the shop!\nHappy drawing! 🙂\nZara Roza Designs",
  "fullDescription": "<p>A bundle pack of 10+ Procreate watercolor brushes for digital art of the iPad / iPad Pro app. A natural realistic watery paint blending effect for blending and smudging colors and producing a wet ink. Giving an emotional and painterly aesthetic to illustrating, painting, drawing features and makeup in portrait art, faces, eyes, nose, lips, contouring, sketching landscape art, clouds, oceans, forests, distressed grunge watercolor paintings, character art, anime, abstract designs, graphic design drawn features, fashion illustrations and more. The brushes have pressure sensitivity and are compatible with the Apple Pencil. They start with more paint when you press more and some have pressure sensitive width too so the paint strokes have a have a brush-like effect of being finer width when you press less and getting wider when you press more. Comes as 1 .brushset file in a .zip file.</p>\n<p>INCLUDES:<br>\n1 .brushset file with 14 brushes</p>\n<p>*REQUIRES PROCREATE APP &amp; IPAD / IPAD PRO</p>\n<p>Thanks so much for stopping by the shop!</p>\n<p>Happy drawing! 🙂</p>\n<p>Zara Roza Designs</p>",
